What is a Merchant Cash Advance (MCA) Platform?
Merchant Cash Advance (MCA) platforms are specialized fintech solutions crucial for business liquidity and operational agility. These platforms facilitate rapid funding by advancing capital against future sales receivables, typically from credit and debit card transactions, using a factor rate model rather than interest. They encompass key processes such as instant application reviews, AI-powered underwriting, automated remittances, and performance tracking. The platforms include brokerage networks, lender portals, risk management tools, payment integrations, compliance engines, and others.

